OL,3,GNEWSAVirtual tour helps access to
OL,4,Aprotected heathland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new online tour which enables people
OL,7,Fto experience the beauty of an
OL,8,Fimportant conservation site has been
OL,9,Flaunched.
OL,11,FEast Devon's Pebblebed Heaths are the
OL,12,Flargest continuous expanse of lowland
OL,13,Fheathland in Devon, covering over 1,400
OL,14,Fhectares of rare and protected habitat.
OL,16,FThe virtual tour is designed by South
OL,17,FEast Devon Wildlife in collaboration
OL,18,Fwith the RSPB, The Pebblebed Heaths
OL,19,FConservation Trust and the Devon
OL,20,FWildlife Trust.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
